    "tour.slide.mailbox.title": "Your inbox",
    "tour.slide.mailbox.text": "One rule to remember: never delete an email marked “Managed by Aaron”. He needs it to follow the conversation, and tracking would stop dead. Aaron checks your mailbox every 5 minutes, then files those emails into his “Managed by Aaron” folder himself — so just leave them alone, your inbox stays clean. As soon as the customer replies, the email comes back to you on its own. And if you want to take a contact back, untick “Managed by Aaron” on their card: their next emails will stay in your inbox.",
    "billing.pastDueTitle": "Your last payment was declined",
    "billing.pastDueBody": "Nothing is blocked yet: Aaron keeps working normally for {days} more day(s). After that, his AI features pause — your data and history stay intact and readable. Update your card and everything resumes right away.",
    "billing.unpaidTitle": "Aaron is paused",
    "billing.unpaidBody": "The payment could not be settled. Aaron no longer writes or sends emails, but your contacts, history and documents are intact and still readable. Update your card to switch everything back on immediately.",
    "billing.updateCard": "Update my card",
