    'chat.welcomeBullet1': 'while you\'re driving, having lunch or sleeping, I\'m out prospecting: I go find, one by one, prospects that truly match your customer profile (area, industry, company size);',
    'chat.welcomeBullet2': 'I write to them and follow up on your behalf, from your own mailbox, tailoring every message to the person and to what they reply;',
    'chat.welcomeBullet3': 'I spot signals of interest, fill in your prospect file as the conversation unfolds, and above all: what I guarantee you are meetings — by phone, in person or by video call, straight into your calendar.',
    'chat.welcomeNotDoing': 'What I don\'t do: no mass emailing and no bought lists — here, everything is done one by one, personalized and fully managed. And I never make final decisions for you (quotes, pricing, commitments): closing always stays your call.',
    'chat.welcomeBeforeStart': 'Let\'s define your business together. Before I head out into the field, I need to get to know your business — a few quick questions, one at a time, it takes about 2 minutes in total.',
    'chat.welcomeProfileAlreadyDone': 'Good news: your company profile is already in place — your team filled it in, and I\'m using it for you right away (you can view it in My account → My company). No need to redo the questions. We can start right now: tell me who you\'d like me to prospect, or add your first prospects.',
    'chat.questionnaireProgressLabel': 'Questionnaire progress',
    'chat.onboardingQ1': 'To start with: what industry do you work in most often?',
    'chat.onboardingQ1b': 'And what size of company do you usually work with (small business, mid-size, large enterprise...)?',
    'chat.onboardingQ2': 'Do you have a single, fairly homogeneous customer type, or several distinct profiles?',
    'chat.onboardingQ3': 'And a slightly more personal question: how would you describe your clients\' behavior or personality in general (in a rush, wary, chatty, matter-of-fact...)? No need to be precise, just write it as it comes to you.',
    'chat.onboardingQ4': 'What\'s your flagship product or service, the one you offer most often?',
    'chat.onboardingQ5': 'What\'s the argument that lands best with your prospects most often?',
    'chat.onboardingQ6': 'What\'s the objection or hesitation you hear most often?',
    'chat.onboardingQ7': 'And ideally for you after a first contact: get a meeting, send a quote, offer a free trial, or something else?',
    'chat.onboardingCompleteDocs': 'Perfect, thanks! If you have a sample quote, a brochure or a price list handy, you can send them to me right here in the chat (the 📎 icon just below) or from "My documents" — it helps me represent you even better with prospects. Otherwise, just click "Generate my summary" below and I\'ll tell you what I\'ve understood about your business.',
    'chat.summaryErrorFallback': 'I don\'t have enough information yet to write a summary — add a document or describe your business to me here.',
    'chat.summaryIntro': 'Here\'s what I\'ve understood about your business:',
    'chat.summaryOutro': 'We can always adjust it later. Now I suggest a short guided tour of the app — click "See how the app works" below.',
    'chat.restartQuestionnaireIntro': 'Let\'s go through the questionnaire again so I understand your business better:',
    "chat.restartOfferTitle": "Your company profile isn't complete yet. Want to go through the questionnaire together again? It takes five minutes — and it will replace your previous answers.",
    "chat.quickReplyRestartYes": "Yes, let's redo it",
    "chat.quickReplyRestartNo": "No, later",
    "chat.restartDeclinedMessage": "No problem, we'll keep it for later. I'm here if you need anything else.",
