    'tour.slide.dashboard.title': 'Dashboard',
    'tour.slide.dashboard.text': 'Your overview: what Aaron did today, your next appointments, your running campaigns. The bubbles at the top of the page are your notifications, like stories: tap one to approve what Aaron prepared for you.',
    'tour.slide.prospects.title': 'Contacts',
    'tour.slide.prospects.text': 'All your contacts on a single progress line: in progress → promising → meeting booked → proposal requested → negotiating → client. Aaron moves them forward on his own; on each card, the ring shows his confidence for the next step, and “Move” lets you take over. Tip to try Aaron safely: create a test prospect here by hand with a variant of your own email address (e.g. name+test1@gmail.com — Gmail still delivers it to your inbox), see how Aaron replies to you, then delete it and launch your real campaign :)',
    'tour.slide.sales.title': 'Opportunities',
    'tour.slide.sales.text': 'Once an appointment is booked: priced quotes from your catalog, advice before each meeting, follow-ups through to signature — and e-signature sending to close the deal.',
    'tour.slide.customer.title': 'Clients',
    'tour.slide.customer.text': 'As soon as a client is won: automatic onboarding, health tracking, replies to common requests, and alerts if a client shows signs of dissatisfaction.',
    'tour.slide.campaigns.title': 'Campaigns',
    'tour.slide.campaigns.text': 'The “+” launches prospecting on a geographic area — Aaron finds the companies, writes to the right person, follows up and negotiates a meeting for you, without you writing a single email. The strip at the top sums up your campaigns: contacts, meetings, win rate.',
    'tour.slide.agenda.title': 'Calendar',
    'tour.slide.agenda.text': 'Your day at the top of the page, then the calendar with, next to it, this month\'s appointments, your usual slots and your unavailability. Aaron only offers meetings within those slots, manages your Google or Outlook calendar and avoids conflicts. And since it\'s your real calendar, everything shows up on your phone.',
    'tour.slide.resultats.title': 'My results',
    'tour.slide.resultats.text': 'Your progress line in numbers, three reports (day, week, month), the conversion rate from one step to the next, the average time between steps and the losses — plus a comparison of two periods to know what really works.',
    'tour.slide.documents.title': 'My documents',
    'tour.slide.documents.text': 'Upload a sample quote, a brochure, a price list — Aaron reads them, summarizes them, and uses them to better represent you to prospects.',
    'tour.slide.chat.title': 'Chat with Aaron',
    'tour.slide.chat.text': 'Ask your questions, request sales advice. Any suggestion about the tool is automatically forwarded to the founder, with no email to write.',
    'tour.slide.connexions.title': 'My account',
    'tour.slide.connexions.text': 'Everything is here, as a list: your profile, your company (what Aaron understood of your business), your mailbox and calendar (Google or Microsoft) with the “Getting started” checklist, your preferences, CRMs, your subscription and credits. Turn on push notifications from the checklist to be alerted on your phone as soon as a meeting is proposed.',
    'tour.slide.push.title': 'Push notifications',
    'tour.slide.push.text': 'To get notified on your phone as soon as an appointment is proposed, turn on push notifications: go to My account > Preferences and tap "Enable push notifications on this device". Do this on every device (computer, phone) where you want to be notified — picking "Push" in your notification preferences alone isn\'t enough.',
    'tour.slide.team.title': 'My team',
    'tour.slide.team.text': 'An overview of each salesperson: their statistics and activity, at a glance.',
    'tour.slide.suggestions.title': 'Suggestions',
    'tour.slide.suggestions.text': 'Feedback from your team, whether flagged manually or automatically detected by Aaron in a conversation.',
    'tour.previous': 'Previous',
